# Public allowlist for the initial project stage.
# Coursework, management records, experiments and unreviewed files stay local.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/01_需求与设计/
/01_需求与设计/*
!/01_需求与设计/功能范围与验收草案.md
!/01_需求与设计/原型/
/01_需求与设计/原型/*
!/01_需求与设计/原型/核心页面低保真原型.html

# Credentials, dependencies and generated files must remain excluded.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/application-local.yml
**/application-local.yaml
**/application-local.properties
**/credentials.json
**/secrets.json
**/node_modules/
**/target/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
**/uploads/
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/__pycache__/
**/~$*
*.log
*.pyc
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
